{"product_id":"tooter-pepperday-stepping-stone-paper","title":"Tooter Pepperday (Stepping Stone, paper)","description":"\u003cp\u003eA charming rural romp chapter book from Newbery Medalist Jerry Spinelli. And don't miss the author's highly anticipated new middle grade novel, Dead Wednesday!The Pepperday family is moving to Aunt Sally’s farm. Mr. Pepperday, Mrs. Pepperday, and Chuckie Pepperday are happy as hogs in slop. But Tooter Pepperday is not. There’s no cable TV, no playground, and she’s gone three days without pizza! What does a girl have to do to show her family she’ll never get used to life on the farm?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 133 x 194\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Jerry Spinelli\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780679847021\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 96\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45834338959513,"sku":"17RD-39780679847021","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ff77b52f04d_Tooter_Pepperday__Stepping_Stone__paper__Jerry_Spinelli.jpg?v=1761588371","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/tooter-pepperday-stepping-stone-paper","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}